"            победителей: %(winners)s ·\n"
"            призёров: %(prizes)s ·\n"
"            участников: %(participants)s"
msgstr ""
"Total records: %(total)s ·\n"
"            winners: %(winners)s ·\n"
"            prize-winners: %(prizes)s ·\n"
"            participants: %(participants)s"

#: journal/templates/journal/export/index.html
msgid ""
"Всего отметок: %(count)s. Можно выбрать группу, программу и период.\n"
"        Файл содержит два листа: сами отметки и сводку по ученикам."
msgstr ""
"Total marks: %(count)s. You can choose a group, a programme and a period.\n"
"        The file contains two sheets: the marks themselves and a summary by student."

#: journal/templates/journal/absences/list.html
