msgstr "Weeks can only be paged inside the term: on the first week the “Previous week” button and on the last one the “Next week” button are grey, with no link. A week from an old link is brought to the nearest allowed one — with the hint “This week is outside the term”. The same on the teacher page “By week: topics and hours”."

