msgstr "Marks: <span class=\"font-mono\">Present</span>, <span class=\"font-mono\">Absent</span>, <span class=\"font-mono\">Late</span> — the totals are visible for every class. Next to them there is a topic field and a “Mark” button that opens the marks journal for that day."

