msgstr "Skipped because of clashes (%(count)s): %(rows)s. %(hint)s"

#: journal/templates/journal/security/index.html
msgid ""
"Публикуйте сайт только по HTTPS (сертификат Let's Encrypt и обратный прокси),\n"
"                затем включите <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT=1</code>,\n"
"                <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=1</code>,\n"
"                <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">CSRF_COOKIE_SECURE=1</code> и\n"
"                <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS=1</code>."
msgstr ""
"Publish the site over HTTPS only (a Let's Encrypt certificate and a reverse proxy),\n"
"                then enable <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT=1</code>,\n"
"                <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=1</code>,\n"
"                <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">CSRF_COOKIE_SECURE=1</code> and\n"
"                <code class=\"rounded bg-white px-1\">TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS=1</code>."

#: journal/models.py
msgid "Пусто — бессрочно. Автоблокировка за подозрительные запросы ставится на сутки."
msgstr "Empty — no expiry. Automatic blocking for suspicious requests is set for one day."

#: journal/models.py
msgid "Пусто — занятие повторяется каждую неделю"
msgstr "Empty — the class repeats every week"

