msgstr "This is a showcase for displaying the journal without a password: the students, the schedule and the marks are made up. The year, term and branch can be chosen here, the pages open and work as usual, but <span class=\"font-medium\">nothing is saved</span>. The demonstration data live in a <span class=\"font-medium\">separate database</span> and do not get into the live journal."

